Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.09,0:01:06.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（索纳岛 努布拉岛西南87英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:24.63,Title,0,0,0,0,,《侏罗纪公园2：失落的世界》{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太美了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks fabulous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 杰佛瑞 - 不客气 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Geoffrey. - You're welcome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要一瓶红酒 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll also take a bottle of red as well. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 巴里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Barry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气真好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks wonderful. Beautiful day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 你上哪儿去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃三明治 - 别吃太饱 还有你爱吃的明虾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To eat my sandwich. - You won't be hungry for prawns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不爱吃明虾 - 亲爱的 别乱走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't like prawns. - Darling, don't wander off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 别管她吧 迪尔德丽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, leave her alone, Deirdre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去玩你的球吧 - 别这么烦好不好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go play with your ball. - Don't be so annoying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…要是遇到蛇怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what about snakes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,海滩上根本没有蛇 就让她自己玩一次吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't any snakes on the beach. Just let her enjoy herself for once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么？小鸟吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, a little bird or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿吗？来 咬一口 这是烤牛肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hungry? Take a bite. It's roast beef.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道很好的 过来吧 我不会伤害你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good. Come on. I won't hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！爸！快来看！我发现了什么！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummy! Daddy! Come see this! I found something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡茜 亲爱的 吃午饭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cathy, darling, lunch is ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也要吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you looking at this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕不够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm afraid there isn't enough to go around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:03:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡茜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cathy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能快一点吗？动作快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you hurry up? Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're him, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个科学家 我在电视上见过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scientist? The guy? I saw you on TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l believed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who shall I tell Mr. Hammond is calling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩·马尔科姆 哈蒙德先生叫我来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan Malcolm. l've been summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Malcolm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 马尔科姆博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dr. Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你真高兴！- 我也是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's so great to see you. - It's so great to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 看看你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来看爷爷吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to see Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他叫我来的 你知道有什么事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he called me. Do you know what it's about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚 这地方有些恐怖 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't, either. This joint's kind of creepy, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls everything okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.73,0:07:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆博士 到这儿来 和我叔叔分享故事来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Malcolm. Here to share a few campfire stories with my uncle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你想跟华盛顿邮报和那些街头小报说什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Convince the Washington Post and Sceptical Inquirer of what you want…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但是我在场 我知道发生了什么 你也知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I was there. I know what happened and so do you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为每个选择那样做的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe everyone who chose discretion did so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都是心怀鬼胎吗？甚至 连勒克斯和提姆也一样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for a nefarious motive? Even Lex and Tim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把他们扯进来 这不是一场游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave them out of it. It's not a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 在你去岛上之前你曾签过一个保密协议…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You signed a nondisclosure agreement before you went to the island…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…禁止你向外人提及你所看到的一切 然而你违反了协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that forbade you from discussing what you saw. You violated that agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是没有守信 而你 隐瞒了三个人的死因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l did. And you lied about the deaths of three people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还欺骗大众 让他们以为我是个疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You misinformed the public, which made me look like a nut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,害得我很难过活…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so good for my career…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会对你受到的伤害付一笔丰厚的赔偿金的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a generous compensatory offer for your injuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是对我的侮辱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A payoff and an insult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你虚构事实 掩盖证据 不仅毁了我的名声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you spin reality, cover up evidence, it hurts more than my reputation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I recall…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…因为你向出版社兜售你的故事 你所在的大学把你开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your university revoked your tenure for your selling wild stories to the press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:08:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有兜售什么故事 我分文未取 而且讲的都是事实真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't sell anything. I took no money and I told the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是你的版本而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your version of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相只有一个版本 国际遗传「InGen」公司不能再…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no "versions" of the truth. lnGen can't keep spewing out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司由我负责 我会全力维护其利益的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lnGen is my responsibility. I will jealously defend its interests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你负责？哈蒙德先生呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours? What about Mr. Hammond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须向董事会交待 而不是我的叔叔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt is our board of directors I must face, not my uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 你的问题微不足道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, your problems are about to be rendered moot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要几周时间 人们就会永远忘记了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln a few weeks' time, they'll be long forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会忘记的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件衣服你可买不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This suit cost more than your education.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 我错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right and I was wrong. There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到我会这么说吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever expect to hear me say such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好还有B区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God for Site B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,B区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Site B?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,努布拉岛只是一个向游人开放的展示中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lsla Nublar was just a showroom for tourists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:09:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,索那岛上的B区才是制造它们的地方 距离努布拉岛80英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Site B was the factory floor. lsla Sorna, 80 miles from Nublar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那儿孵化并饲养他们几个月…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bred the animals there, nurtured them for a few months…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,…然后将他们运往公园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then moved them into the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我没有听说过啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I did not know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,公园的那次事故以后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the accident in the park…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…克拉丽莎飓风摧毁了B区上的设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Hurricane Clarissa wiped out our facility on Site B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是天意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it an act of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须离开那里 让它们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to evacuate. The animals were released…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…自生自灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to mature on their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是曾经说过：「生命总有出路 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Life will find a way, " as you once so eloquently put it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 岛上已经拥有了完整的生态系统…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By now we have a complete ecological system on the island…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.01,0:09:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…各种物种分群而居…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with dozens of species living in social groups…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…没有任何限制和拘束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without fences, boundaries or constraining technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.27,0:09:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for four years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我一直尽力使之免受人类干扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l've tried to keep it safe from human interference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 希望你能隔离这个小岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Hopefully, you've kept the island quarantined and contained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是很震惊 它们居然都还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But l'm in shock. I mean, that they're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们没有赖氨酸供应了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bred them lysine-deficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,七天内没有的补充就会死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't they have kicked after seven days without supplemental enzymes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但是它们却生龙活虎 简直难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, by God, they're flourishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我要队员找出答案的众多问题之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one of 1, 000 questions I want the team to answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,队员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我组织了一个探险队进入小岛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've organised an expedition to go in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…谢谢 并且{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…thank you, and document them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把他们所见到的壮观的活化石都统统记录下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make the most spectacular living fossil record the world has ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录？你要派人进去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go in and document? You mean with people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那些恐龙不会知道他们在那儿 影响很小的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the animals won't know they're there. Very low impact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.45,0:10:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是作观察和记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strictly observation and documentation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的卫星红外图显示 它们的领土性极强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our satellite infrareds show the animals are fiercely territorial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉食恐龙在岛中心…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The carnivores are isolated in the interior of the island…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…所以队员可以只待在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so the team can stay on the outer rim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我不会再犯同样的错误的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. l'm not making the same mistakes again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你总是犯新的错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're making all new ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰！这个岛上有恐龙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! So, there's another island with dinosaurs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…并且这次没有栅栏 而你却要派人上去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no fences this time, and you want to send people in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.48,0:11:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…而且是很少几个人 就在地面上 没错吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…very few people, on the ground, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你要骗哪四个疯子去送死？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are the four lunatics you're trying to con into this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的话的确有些难以置信…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt was hard to convince them of what they would see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…最后还是「有钱能使鬼推磨」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the end had to use my chequebook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有摄影师尼克·范·欧文…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's Nick van Owen, a video documentarian…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…野外设备专家 埃迪·卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Eddie Carr, who's a field equipment expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一名古生物学家…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have our palaeontologist…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.13,0:11:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…并且 我希望你能成为第四个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and, I was hoping that perhaps you might be the fourth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从公园出事以来 我们已经濒临破产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been on the verge of Chapter 11 since that accident in the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司里有人想利用B区…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are those in the company who wanted to exploit Site B…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…解决财政危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in order to bail us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们计划已久 我一直阻止他们的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been planning it for years, but l've stopped them until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 几星期以前 一家乘快艇旅行的英国人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few weeks ago, a British family on a yacht cruise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…无意中到了岛上 他们的小女儿在上面受到了恐龙的伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…stumbled across the island and their wee girl was injured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是董事会利用这次事件掌控公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the board has used the incident to take control of lnGen from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 在这个迷失的世界被发现和掠夺之前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it's only a matter of time before this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…只剩下很少时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…lost world is found and pillaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能利用公众舆论来保护它 但是要得到舆论的支持…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Public opinion is the one thing I can use to preserve it, but to rally that support…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我需要一套完整的照片记录…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l need a complete photo record…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那些恐龙在自然居所中生活的记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of those animals alive in their natural habitat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅四年 你就从资本家 变成了自然保护主义者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you went from capitalist to naturalist in just four years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真了不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的最后机会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our last chance at redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不答应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会去联系小组的另外三个人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And l'm going to contact the other three members of your team…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…说服他们不要去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and stop them from going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 谁是那个古生物学家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the palaeontologist, by the way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.09,0:12:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你知道是她找上我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came to me, I want you to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你之外 伊恩 我们同…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to you, lan, to have associations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…其他很多领域的专家也都有联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even liaisons with the best people in so many fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有联系莎拉吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,古生物行为学研究是一个新兴领域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Palaeontological behaviour study is a new field, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·哈丁就在此前沿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sarah Harding is on that frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在肉食动物界养育幼兽的理论成就非凡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her theories on parenting and nurturing in carnivores have framed the debate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.45,0:13:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么？- 电话在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Where's your phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经到那儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's already there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人将会在三天后与她会面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others are meeting her in three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我的女友一个人到岛上去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent my girlfriend to this island alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我「让」她去 是她自己迫不及待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sent" is hardly the word. She couldn't be restrained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经到了圣达戈 在公园里做一些研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was already in San Diego, doing research at the animal park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机到哪儿只要几个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a few hours' flight from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.11,0:13:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很坚强 对于她自己的首次 拿着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was adamant, absolutely adamant about, here you are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…首次尝试她绝不会动摇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…about making the initial foray by herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很有使命感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks she's Dian Fossey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还说什么「观察而不受干扰」 你也知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Observation without interference, " she said. You know how it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在公园受伤以后 她去找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you were injured in the park, she sought you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还去哥斯达黎加的医院…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she went all the way to a hospital in Costa Rica…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…询问谣言是否真实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to ask someone she didn't know if the rumours were true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果想名留青史 我不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to leave your name on something, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是请不要让其他人去送死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But stop putting it on other people's headstones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会没事的 她花了数年时间研究非洲的猎食动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be fine. She's spent years studying African predators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很清楚她在做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleeping downwind and all. She knows what she's doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 研究小组会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, believe me, the research team will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经不再是一次研究行动 而是一次营救行动 现在就走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a research expedition anymore. It's a rescue operation and it's leaving now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法提前三天就全部做好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can't shave three days off my deadline and expect to be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有补给 我还没有对它进行完全测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm not supplied. I haven't tested any of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么让她用卫星电话？万一不起作用怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why give her a satellite phone if it doesn't work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.19,0:15:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有很多原因 比如太阳耀斑 卫星故障 或者她没有开机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be solar flares, the satellite, or maybe she turned it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮胎别充满气 高空气压低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l need half air on the tires. We're flying pressurised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.53,0:15:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她知道怎么用吧？- 你开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does she know how to use it? - You kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿有一半是她要求的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's faxed me refinements on half the plans for this stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么用力 你得像对待小孩一样的爱护它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that. You have to baby it. Love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱护它就能用 - 让我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'll love it when it works. - It'll work when you love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一起来吗？- 我通常不喜欢一起走 不过这次我忍不住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You coming along? - I don't usually, but I can't resist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你两分钟叫我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the two-minute warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.59,0:15:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克·范·欧文 这是伊恩·马尔科姆 尼克是摄影师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick van Owen, lan Malcolm. Nick's our photographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的专长是野生动物摄影？- 野生动物 战争 什么都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do wildlife photography? - Wildlife, combat, you name it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去过卢旺达 车臣 波士尼亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was with Nightline, I was in Rwanda, Chechnya, Bosnia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一段时间我还志愿为绿色和平组织工作过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l do volunteer work for Greenpeace once in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么吸引你去绿色和平组织的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What drew you to Greenpeace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:15:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色和平组织里面80%是女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greenpeace is 80-percent female.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,高尚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年我是高尚 今年我要钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noble was last year. This year l'm getting paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈蒙德的支票兑现 我才肯去追踪猎物 否则不是白费力气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hammond's check cleared, or I wouldn't go on this wild-goose chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去的将是唯一一个猎物追踪你的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to the only place where the geese chase you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！爸爸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.09,0:16:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽 宝贝 你终于到了 怎么用了这么长的时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, honey, you found it. What took you so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫不到计程车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't get a cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 没关系 我要和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, that's okay. l've got to tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我根本不认识这个女的 - 你认识凯伦已经10年了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't even know this woman. - You've known Karen for 10 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她连世嘉游戏机都没有 真是落伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have Sega. She's such a troglodyte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用的字眼真妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruel, but good word use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我不能和莎拉在一起？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I stay with Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她出去了 凯伦人很好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out of town. Karen's fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带你去骑马 看电影 你会玩得很开心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll take you places. You'll have a fantastic time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别老是说她好 你要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop saying "fantastic." Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是几天时间 如果没有重要的事我是不会走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only for a few days. I wouldn't be going if it wasn't important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:17:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我始终是你的女儿 任何情况下你也不应该扔下我不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm your daughter full time. You can't abandon me whenever opportunity knocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说太伤人了 你妈妈教你的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurts. Your mom tell you to say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆博士 请到楼下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Malcolm, downstairs, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们以前相处得不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know we've had some hard going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是过去这几年我们已经开始有所转变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the last few years, we've started to work things out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 不过我要你对我严一点 禁足之类 把我关在屋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but crack on me a bit. Ground me or something. Send me to my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来都没有这么做过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never do any of that stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要那么做？你是如此…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would l? You turned out so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…美丽 大方 健康 有趣 杰出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…beautiful, brilliant, powerful, funny and generous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的女王 女神和灵感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen, goddess. My inspiration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以做你的助研 像奥斯丁那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l could come be your research assistant, like in Austin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次情况不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nothing like Austin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且 你还有自己的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, you have your own stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要参加体操比赛 为此你已经准备了好几个月了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gymnastics competition. You've been training for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,体操比赛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gymnastics?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.25,0:17:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经从队里面刷下来了 多谢关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l scrubbed out, got cut from the team. Thanks for knowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm sorry, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那对你有多重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know how much that meant to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.35,0:17:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很爱孩子 只是不想陪他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like having kids. You just don't want to be with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有把你丢下跑到巴黎 别拿我出气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt wasn't me who dumped you and split for Paris, so don't take it out on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆博士 快下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Malcolm, downstairs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 对不起！对不起！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, l'm sorry. l'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想听听父亲的建议吗？那就是别听我的 别听我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some good parental advice? Don't listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.01,0:18:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明书说它能承受12000磅/平方英寸的压力 我们试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The specs say it can't deform at 12, 000 PSl, so we'll test it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来看看 可以了吗？- 这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's clear. We clear? - What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,高处藏身用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A high hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所想 人可以躲在里面 吊在高处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A high hide. You know, you go up and hide, high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它吊在树上 可以保护研究人员的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt goes up to where the trees are and keeps the researchers out of harm's way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 这样更是把他们送到了恐龙嘴边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it puts them at a very convenient biting height.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点了？你有表吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你问我几点干嘛？- 我们三小时后启程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - We're leaving in three hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lindstradt 气步枪 以亚音速发射Fluger飞镖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lindstradt air rifle. Fires a subsonic Fluger dart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这玩意儿比你的卫星电话更有用吗？- 你很幽默{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt work better than your satellite phone? - Funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面装有从南半球海洋中 的鸡心螺提炼的浓缩毒液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l loaded it with enhanced venom from Conus purpurascens: South Sea cone shell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上最强的神经毒素 千分之二秒内生效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most powerful neurotoxin in the world. Acts within 0.002 of a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,比神经传导速度还要快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster than nerve-conduction velocity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 恐龙还没感觉到中镖就已经倒下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the animal's down before it even feels the dart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有解药吗？- 怎么？害怕打到自己的脚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ls there an antidote? - Like if you shot yourself in the foot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.02,0:20:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别那么干 不然你还没反应过来就已经归天了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that. You'd be dead before you realised it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他打算就在这儿卸货 他不会再往上游去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he's unloading us here. He won't go further up the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他听过很多传言 他要我们下船 船就开到这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heard too many stories. He'll drop us off and anchor offshore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么传言？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of stories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说太靠近小岛的渔夫都再也没有回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stories of fishermen that came too close to the island and never returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他有无线电和卫星电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a radio. He has a satellite phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果需要他 打个电话 他两小时就会赶到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you need him, call and he'll be here in two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不会在那儿停留{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he will not stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不愿在任何靠近这些小岛的地方停留{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't stay anywhere near these islands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.44,0:21:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把这些小岛称作「Las Cinco Muertes」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call the islands "Las Cinco Muertes"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「死亡五岛」…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Five Deaths"…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哈丁博士的电话里放了追踪器 我们应该能接收到信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l put a location sensor in Dr. Harding's phone, so we should get a reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.05,0:22:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真欣慰 - 不要乱按{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm so relieved. - Don't push my buttons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在几乎就在她的位置 她应该就在附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost on top of her dot. She should be around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·哈丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Harding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.95,0:22:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这个岛上有几个莎拉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many Sarahs do you think are on this island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么动静？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.34,0:23:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太壮丽了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is magnificent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 开始你总会说「哇 啊」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah."Ooh, ah, " that's how it always starts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是过一会儿就只有尖叫和逃命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then later there's running and screaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.50,0:23:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.79,0:23:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先我们一步到这儿吧 莎拉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l guess you got the jump on us, didn't you, Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.50,0:23:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.09,0:24:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 我怎么也没想到哈蒙德会把你找来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan, I never thought Hammond could get you to come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 埃迪 - 你好 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Eddie. - Hi, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.14,0:24:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有格兰诺拉麦片或者其他什么吃的吗？我饿死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a granola bar or something? l'm starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那些恐龙了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see those animals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.23,0:24:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一家子 父母和它们的子女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A family group, a pair-bond and a subadult, long after the juvenile was nest bound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.70,0:24:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到每个巢穴都有破碎的蛋壳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every egg clutch l've seen has crushed, trampled shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.78,0:24:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚孵出的幼龙会在巢里待很长时间 这是我的观点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hatchlings stay in the birth environment a long time. That's conclusive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.54,0:24:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能够多看一些巢穴 就能够证实这个观点了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can end that controversy if I get a shot of the nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.33,0:24:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有受到攻击？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been attacked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.33,0:24:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 那是我的幸运背包 它总能给我带来好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's my lucky pack. That's how it always looks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.05,0:24:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ok 莎拉…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Sarah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.47,0:24:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是尼康相机？我能借一下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls that a Nikon? Can I borrow it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.10,0:24:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来 我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll be right back, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.31,0:24:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 哈蒙德通知你的时候 为什么你都不跟我说一声？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Hammond called you, why didn't you say something to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.44,0:25:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道你一定会阻止我来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l knew you would have stopped me from coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.86,0:25:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该把你绑在床上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l would have tied you to the bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.24,0:25:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道它们为什么没有赖氨酸也能生存下来了 - 我才不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know how they survived without lysine. - I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.86,0:25:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那些草食恐龙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The herbivore species that are thriving…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…吃的都是鬣蜥豆 大豆 以及其他富含赖氨酸的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…eat mostly agama beans, soy, anything lysine-rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那些肉食恐龙则以草食恐龙为食 于是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the carnivores eat the herbivores, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿 别出声 我马上回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there. Be quiet. l'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.92,0:26:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她靠得太近了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's much too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.46,0:26:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在做什么？- 太近了！太近了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is she doing? - Too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.65,0:26:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她忍不住摸它了 她确实忍不住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has to touch it. She can't not touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.20,0:26:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么她就非要去摸呢？- 她一看到新鲜东西就忍不住…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's going right up to it. - Once she sees something, she has to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.96,0:26:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls this even possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.13,0:26:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你将要拍到或者看到什么情景？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This? What did you think you'd document? What did you think you'd see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.76,0:26:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙 或者…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animals. Maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.10,0:26:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大蜥蜴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…big iguanas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.65,0:27:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fruitcakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.49,0:27:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got very angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.29,0:27:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.38,0:27:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只是在保护孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're protecting their baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.13,0:27:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am l!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.94,0:27:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它们走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think they're leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.25,0:28:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊心动魄 有的人一辈子也没见过有这一半精彩的场面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lncredible. Guys shoot their whole life and never get stuff half this good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.25,0:28:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我颁发普利策奖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the Pulitzer right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.42,0:28:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,评比结束 其他人也不必再来了 我要感谢每一个输家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The competition's over, close the entries, l'd like to thank everyone who lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.72,0:28:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抽烟 恐龙几英里以外就能闻到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't light that! Dinosaurs pick up scents from miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.39,0:28:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这是观察和记录的 不是来和他们「交流」的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to observe and document, not interact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.27,0:28:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 这是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is a scientific impossibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.14,0:28:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据海森堡测不准原理 无论你做什么 最后总得有些变化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heisenberg Uncertainty Principle. What you study, you change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.69,0:28:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意冒这个险 我讨厌拿着化石摸来摸去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll risk it. l'm sick of scratching around in rock and bone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.23,0:28:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…然后对已经灭绝六千五百万年的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…making assumptions about the nurturing habits of animals…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…恐龙抚养幼兽的习性作出假设{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that have been dead for 65 million years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.37,0:28:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就往我的脑袋里灌输你的故事 所以我一定得来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you fill my head with stories. Of course I came down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.20,0:28:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说有人连命都丢了 你有没有注意听啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stories of mutilation and death. Were you paying attention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.29,0:28:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别把我当成你的研究生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Don't treat me like a grad student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从20岁就开始研究猎食动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've worked around predators since I was 20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.84,0:28:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮子 豺 鬣狗 还有你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lions, jackals, hyenas, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿着火了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.43,0:29:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在试图改变百年来的教条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm trying to change 100 years of entrenched dogma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.48,0:29:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙被形容为残暴的大蜥蜴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinosaurs were characterised early on as vicious lizards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.32,0:29:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那些父母抚养幼龙的行为 正好可以推翻这个观点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's resistance to the idea of them as nurturing parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.82,0:29:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯特·伯克说霸王龙会抛弃幼龙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert Burke said the T. Rex was a rogue…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.45,0:29:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…谁都有年轻的时候 我可以证明他错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who abandoned its young at the first opportunity. I can prove otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.62,0:29:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,火！马尔科姆博士 营地有火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire! Dr. Malcolm, fire, base camp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.67,0:29:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！用水会冒烟 用土！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Water makes the smoke billow. Use dirt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.80,0:29:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁生的火？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who started the fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.05,0:29:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想做晚饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l just wanted to make dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.76,0:29:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在你们回来之前就弄好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wanted it ready when you guys got back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.02,0:29:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,发觉了吗？这父女俩多象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see any family resemblance there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.06,0:29:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是你让我来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You practically told me to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.98,0:29:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.77,0:29:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说「别听我的」 我想你是想告诉我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said, "Don't listen to me." I thought you were trying to tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.69,0:29:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽 你应该明白我是什么意思 你太不懂事了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, you knew exactly what I meant. You have no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.66,0:30:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把她关起来吗？她的好奇心从哪儿来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to lock her up for her curiosity? Where do you think she gets it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.49,0:30:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 莎拉 - 你不要跟她一个鼻孔出气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Sarah. - Don't start the teaming-up thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.37,0:30:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈话到此结束 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the conversation. Please. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.63,0:30:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 这玩意儿怎么一直都不起作用？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, why doesn't this thing ever work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.51,0:30:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是有线电话 和你打公用电话不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a land line. You're not in a phone booth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.01,0:30:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得等合适的信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for a decent signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴力和科技从来都合不来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence and technology: not good bedfellows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.31,0:30:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈蒙德要你带着设备尽量接近恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hammond wants your equipment as close to the animals as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.57,0:30:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意 你不如再涂点羊血在身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great idea. And why don't you smear on a little sheep's blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.28,0:30:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 你能肯定拖车里的无线电能用吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, is there any reason to think the radio in the trailer might work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.37,0:30:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿我开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tease me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.99,0:30:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你这么在行 就打开开关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you feel qualified, try flicking the switch to "on."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.04,0:30:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 我要带我女儿离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, l'm taking my daughter out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人一起走吗？这可是你们最后的机会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone coming with me, this is your last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.50,0:30:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们离开这儿进去以后什么也不能做…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're out in the field…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.09,0:31:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 你如果能活下来 我会通知你太太或者你爱的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick, if you're staying, l'll gladly deliver a letter to your wife or loved one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.55,0:31:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…再见了老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so you can say good-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.51,0:31:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 你如果有什么随身物品需要带…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, if you have any personal effects…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你知道 这至少是我能做的 我会帮忙的 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's the least I can do. l'll be in there, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.73,0:31:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得做到百分之百不存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our presence needs to be 100-percent antiseptic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.48,0:31:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算踩断一根草…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we so much as bend a blade of grass…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.02,0:31:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 你疯了吗？- 没有 我没疯 我只是太气愤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, are you mad? - No, l'm not mad. l'm furious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.78,0:31:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看 弄得跟你的屋子一样乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.66,0:31:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会收拾好的 - 现在就收拾！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was going to clean it up. - Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.49,0:31:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西？这里有无数的开关！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? There are 100 switches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.75,0:31:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一点 我本来打算打电话告诉你我来这儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be mad. I was going to call to let you know where I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.88,0:31:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是这样的 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l always do, don't l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.17,0:31:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我属于这世上最好的那一类女友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm the best kind of girlfriend there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个常常旅行在外的人 比如你 不是喜欢独立吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One who travels a lot. You like that. You love your independence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.55,0:31:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实习惯于独处 但那并不代表我喜欢独处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've gotten used to being apart, but that's not how I want to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.10,0:31:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽 这儿是大人谈话 就几分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, this is tall talk. Just for a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.81,0:31:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像游乐场里云霄飞车的限制一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a height restriction at an amusement park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的想救我 你为什么三个星期以前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanted to rescue me, why didn't you save me from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.86,0:32:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不把我从博物馆筹委会中救出来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that museum fundraiser three weeks ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.86,0:32:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还是有些不一样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a slightly different situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.37,0:32:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我陪你父母吃饭的时候你也从来不出现 这又怎么讲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the dinner with your parents you never showed up for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.04,0:32:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我需要你的时候你不出现？你什么时候遵守过你的承诺？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not rescue me when I need it? Be there when you say you will?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.17,0:32:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把等你当成了一种职业了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l have made a career out of waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.92,0:32:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 莎拉有一个很好的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she has a pretty good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.26,0:32:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了！这对你是有好处的 这是个人隐私 出去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so important to your future that you not finish that sentence. Please, outside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.64,0:32:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 过来 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan, come on. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.56,0:32:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你这个骑着白马的王子 真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l love that you rode in here on a white horse. I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.82,0:32:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感人 非常戏剧化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very touching, very dramatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.65,0:32:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望你也偶尔能出现在马车中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l just need you to show up in a cab now and then, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.86,0:32:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？别出去 太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Don't go out there. It's not safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.99,0:32:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿 回来 关上门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in here. Come back. Shut the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.79,0:33:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我在做什么 你们当然可以走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know what l'm doing. You guys should definitely go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.55,0:33:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我会留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But l'm staying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.84,0:33:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 我只是现在不需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l love you. I just don't need you right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.64,0:33:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要的是强效镇静剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you need is a good anti-psychotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.14,0:33:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我五六天后就会回来 - 你回来的时候已经成五六块了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'll be back in five or six days. - You'll be back in five or six pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.27,0:33:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我没有害怕而你害怕了 所以你这么烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bothers you is that l'm not afraid and you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.36,0:33:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 其实我是想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I am. That's the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.36,0:33:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.00,0:33:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我现在就要让你坐直升飞机回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll get you out on one of these right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.63,0:33:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！这边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.71,0:33:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不明白了 那是国际遗传公司的直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't get it. lt says lnGen on the side of that chopper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.43,0:33:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么哈蒙德派了两队人到这儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't get that. Why would Hammond send two teams?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.77,0:33:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,切脐带 爸爸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the umbilical, Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.06,0:33:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道他不信任我们？我们甚至还没有开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't he trust us? We haven't even started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.11,0:34:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿扎营不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as good a place as any for base camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.66,0:34:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是这件事做完后的第一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's first priority after we're finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.24,0:34:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们30分钟内做好 也就是半个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l want it up and running in 30 minutes. That's half an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.33,0:34:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？完毕 - 取消你的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understood? Over. - Cancel that order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.46,0:34:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.04,0:34:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是猎食路线 肉食动物的猎食路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a game trail. Carnivores hunt on game trails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.55,0:34:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想在这儿扎营还是当恐龙的自助餐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to set up base camp or a buffet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.80,0:34:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们换一个地点扎营 离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find a new spot, shall we? Over and out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.52,0:34:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 如果要我来当你的向导 有两个条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, if I run your little camping trip, there are two conditions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.81,0:34:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 我说了算 如果我不在 听迪特的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, l'm in charge. If l'm not around, Dieter is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.98,0:34:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要给点报酬 夸我们干得很好 下班后提供些威士忌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just pay us, tell us we're doing well, and serve us Scotch after a good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.15,0:34:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 你可以不付我的费用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second, my fee. You can keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.16,0:34:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所想得到的只是猎捕一头霸王龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want for my services, is the right to hunt a Tyrannosaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.04,0:34:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一头雄性的 怎么干和为什么都是我的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A male. A buck only. How and why are my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.96,0:35:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不接受这两个条件 你自己慢慢玩儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't like those conditions, you're on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.75,0:35:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后继续在这儿扎营 在沼泽里 或者在霸王龙的窝里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go ahead, set up base camp here, in a swamp, or in the middle of a Rex nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.38,0:35:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经从很多牙科医生的狩猎队听取自杀性建议了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've had too many safaris with rich dentists to listen to any more suicidal ideas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.64,0:35:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.69,0:35:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩托车手 把迷途的那只从兽群中隔离出来 把它赶到右边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cycle, break off the stray from the herd and flush him to the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.44,0:35:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,钩猎手 准备好 他正在将恐龙往你们那儿赶 你们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snaggers, stay ready. He's bringing them out to you. It'll be a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.32,0:35:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…肿… 肿头… 噢 见鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Pachy… Pachya… Oh, hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.66,0:35:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,长着肥厚的头 上面只有一点是光秃秃的 就叫它「皱头和尚」吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fat head with the bald spot. Friar Tuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.94,0:36:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.23,0:36:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,肿头龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pachycephalosaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.86,0:36:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉食类的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carnivore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.27,0:36:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是草食类的 生存于白垩纪晚期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, herbivore, late Cretaceous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.66,0:36:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意到那独具特色的半球形头骨了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the distinctive domed skull?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.91,0:36:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有9英寸厚 所以 小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine inches of solid bone. Now, careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.96,0:36:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,肿头龙的脖子附在头骨底部 而不是头的后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pachy's neck attaches at the bottom of its skull, not at the back of its head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.88,0:36:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它低下头时 它的脖子和脊椎排成一线…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it lowers its head, its neck lines up with its backbone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.76,0:36:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…能够很好的吸收碰撞的冲击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which is perfect for absorbing impact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.69,0:36:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,钩猎手「皱头和尚」逃跑了 正要穿过你们的前方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snagger, Friar Tuck's on the loose, just about to cross your path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.13,0:37:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪特 坐到外伸架里去 你们正在接近一只副栉…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dieter, get in the outrigger. You're closing in on a carina…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.30,0:38:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍 重复一遍 罗兰 一只什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again, Roland. A what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.97,0:38:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只长着像发髻一样的大红角的恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one with the big red horn. The pompadour. Elvis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.94,0:38:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.87,0:38:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定 卡特 把我收进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Carter, reel me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.42,0:38:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.96,0:38:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要靠得太近！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.76,0:38:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑它的腿！小心它的尾巴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for the legs! The legs! Watch the tail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.18,0:39:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.98,0:39:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.65,0:39:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,认得这个脚印吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recognise this trackway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.53,0:39:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然认得 是霸王龙的脚印{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do. Tyrannosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.74,0:39:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.29,0:39:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要上哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.09,0:40:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,挣我的报酬 勒德洛先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To collect my fee, Mr. Ludlow. To collect my fee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.60,0:40:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.94,0:40:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三叠纪副细颚龙 弗拉斯于1913年在巴伐利亚发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Procompsognathus Triassicus, found by Frass in Bavaria in 1913.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.74,0:40:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它危险吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls it dangerous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.86,0:40:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 应该不危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wouldn't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.37,0:40:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们认为它只是「拾荒者」 就像豺一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Compy's been presumed to be a scavengers, like jackals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.75,0:40:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太令我吃惊了 看起来好像它一点都不害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt gives me the creeps. It's like it's not scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,岛上还从来没有人来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There haven't been any visitors to this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.92,0:40:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没有理由会害怕人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason for it to fear man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.76,0:40:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.78,0:41:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是霸王龙的窝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Rex nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.70,0:41:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能只有两周大 还从来没有离开过窝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably only a couple weeks old. Never left the nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.09,0:41:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,象这么小的幼崽 父母不会离开很长时间的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offspring that young, the parents won't leave him alone for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.76,0:41:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？你要等它爸回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your blind here? Wait for the buck to return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.72,0:41:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 如果窝在上风区 也就是我们现在这个位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the nest is upwind, then so are we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.43,0:41:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它回来时就会知道我们在这儿 那时我们就跑不掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he comes back, he's gonna know we're here without us having a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.02,0:41:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要想法让它…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trick is to get him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.15,0:41:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…去我们想让它去的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to come where we want him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.50,0:42:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是哈蒙德急着让你们来的原因 他知道他们要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why Hammond was in a hurry to get you here. He knew they were coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.88,0:42:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 他们很有组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, they are well-organised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.13,0:42:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些都是最高级的装备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are major-league toys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.05,0:42:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我应该找他们借电话 他们的锅盖比你的大多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should ask to use their phone. Their dish is bigger than yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.43,0:42:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是想在这儿另外建一个公园吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they actually want to build another park here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.35,0:42:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那一个岛出事以后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what you said happened on the other island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.14,0:42:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有打算建任何东西 他们只是把这些恐龙运出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not building anything. They're taking these animals out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.90,0:43:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,运回大陆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the mainland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.73,0:43:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我应该告诉你们 哈蒙德给我说过这些人可能出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think I should tell you. Hammond told me these people might show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.57,0:43:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为我们应该在他们开始之前完成任务 但是如果他们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought we'd be finished by the time they started, but if they weren't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.61,0:43:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他提出了一个后备计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he sent a backup plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.95,0:43:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What backup plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.29,0:43:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.12,0:43:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开门见山 国际遗传公司正在寻求一些我们的赞助商{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simply put, lnGen is seeking limited partners to defray some of our expenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.21,0:43:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,板上给你们详细列出了计划书…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prospectus you've been given by the board details…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.42,0:43:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…包括需要的硬体 建筑费用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our projected hardware and construction expenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.38,0:43:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以看到 软体已经由 我这儿的两个朋友开发完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see by my two friends here, the software is already fully developed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.47,0:43:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以说 「现在就已经开始了 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One might say, "It'd be up and running."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.14,0:43:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,过一会儿 我会带你们在营地四周看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a moment, I'll take you on a stroll through the camp…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.23,0:43:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你们将看到更大 印象更深刻的样品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you'll see some larger, more impressive specimens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.72,0:44:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不需要让人们绕半个地球来参观动物园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't bring people halfway around the world to visit a zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.64,0:44:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把动物园带到他们身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring the zoo to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.89,0:44:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣达戈非常完美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Diego is the perfect setting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.65,0:44:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们已经把对动物的热情和 我们美丽的城市联系在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People already associate our beautiful city with animal attractions:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.23,0:44:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣达戈动物园 海洋世界 圣达戈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Diego Zoo, Sea World, San Diego Chargers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.85,0:45:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈蒙德先生知道这一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Hammond knew this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.39,0:45:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他曾经渴求一个岛屿之前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he ever dreamt of an island…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.98,0:45:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他开始建造这个圆形剧场一样的公园…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he began construction on an amphitheatre…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.78,0:45:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…地点非常靠近各位现在所处 的位置 InGen河岸综合体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…very near to where you're sitting now, the lnGen waterfront complex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.57,0:45:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他后来放弃了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he abandoned it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.33,0:45:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,…为了某种更崇高的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in favour of something far grander…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.75,0:45:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…而且根本不可能实现的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and ultimately impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.29,0:45:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是 这些设施被荒废 并且没有完工…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, the facility sits unused, unfinished…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.67,0:45:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…本来它们再等不了一个月就可以接待游客的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when it could be completed and ready to receive visitors in less than a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.95,0:45:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿杰 小心！跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ajay, look out! Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.94,0:46:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最后一次让你管事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last time I leave you in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.21,0:46:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝 你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Are you out of your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.42,0:46:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的腿断了 我们要在他们 发现我们以前回到车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a broken leg. Let's get in the car before they hear us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.84,0:47:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道你在做什么吗？- 来吧 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have any idea what that is? - Come on, open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.93,0:47:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是顽固透顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.52,0:47:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 伊恩不会喜欢这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, lan's not going to like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.65,0:47:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.40,0:47:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不明显吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it obvious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.95,0:47:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个岛上还有其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not alone on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.00,0:47:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,频率没有设好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not set to the frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.63,0:47:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.11,0:47:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.15,0:48:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.99,0:48:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是恩里克 我是伊恩·马尔科姆 你是船上吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not Enrique. lan Malcolm. Are you on the boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.58,0:48:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是船上吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, is this the boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.04,0:48:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在索纳岛上 我们需要和船上的马德普拉塔通话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on lsla Sorna. We need to talk to the boat, Mar del Plata.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.68,0:48:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接住它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.47,0:48:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我接住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. That's it. I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.14,0:48:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我接住了 - 赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got you. - Hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.52,0:48:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快点 小心它的尾巴 打开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Go. Come on. Watch his tail. Get the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.19,0:48:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 她对你发脾气了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, is she mad at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.53,0:48:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真应该跟那个恩里克说抱歉 - 不要聊天了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I feel sorry for that guy, Enrique. - No lectures, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.45,0:48:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 往后靠 别站在这儿 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, stay back. Don't stand up, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.74,0:48:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我抱住了 - 小心它的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it! - Watch his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.29,0:48:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心它的头 - 伊恩 它受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch his head. - lan, he's hurt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.50,0:48:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 亲爱的 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, honey, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.04,0:48:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会攻击你的 小心尾巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll snip at you. Watch his tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.80,0:49:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了吗？- 好了 我抱住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? - Okay, I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.30,0:49:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱稳了吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got him? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.80,0:49:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你躺在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.14,0:49:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做什么？用棍子打它吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What must I do, hit her with a stick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.64,0:49:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 亲爱的 不要靠近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't get close, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.31,0:49:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心！不要站得太近了 - 它身上有一股难闻的气味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out! Don't stand too close. - He has that not-so-fresh smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.52,0:49:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是恩里克 夫人 够了！频率弄错了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, lady, enough! Wrong frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.70,0:49:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 不要让它碰到周围的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick, don't let him get those things around you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.62,0:49:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.54,0:49:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 慢慢来 让它平静一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy. Just calm down now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.30,0:49:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这儿是跖骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here are the metatarsals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.64,0:49:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,胫骨 腓骨 就是这儿 这儿有裂缝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tibia, fibula. There it is. There's the fracture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.89,0:49:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在骨上方 - 情况糟糕吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right above the epiphysis. - How bad is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.02,0:49:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不固定起来 它会死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't set it, he'll die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.00,0:49:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它自己不会复原 脚踝也不能转动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt won't heal. He won't be able to pivot on his ankle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.69,0:50:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不能跑也不能走 会成为其他肉食恐龙的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be able to run or walk. A predator will pick him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.65,0:50:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛斯 听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlos, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.66,0:50:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 你这个混蛋 听着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, you bastard, listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.83,0:50:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他恐龙会听到它叫的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other animals are going to hear this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.04,0:50:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请听好 你能听见我说话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, please. Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.46,0:50:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须出去 我想离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've got to get out of here. I want to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.79,0:50:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正在跟船上通电话 - 我想换个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm calling the boat. - I want to go someplace else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.59,0:50:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在这儿 我想换个安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't want to be here. I want to be somewhere safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.21,0:50:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿难道不安全吗？- 我想到高处去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Isn't it safe here? - I want to be somewhere high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.63,0:50:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么事？发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.39,0:50:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给点提示 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lnformation, please. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.26,0:50:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好不要知道 让我们上去 这就上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're much happier not knowing. Get us up. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.48,0:50:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.11,0:50:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是笨蛋 我不应该跟你来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm so stupid. I shouldn't have come along with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.28,0:50:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能固定住吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you set it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.40,0:50:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我只是需要让骨头裂缝不再扩大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I just need something temporary to break apart and fall off as he grows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.08,0:50:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄好之后它又会精悍善战了 奎因博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you're ready. He's fighting, Dr. Quinn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.62,0:51:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上的频率是多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the frequency for the boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.88,0:51:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,15888 从上往下第三个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}15888. Third from the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.63,0:51:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 现在我们在高处了 这儿是最安全的地方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're high. This is the safest place you can be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.05,0:51:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如莎拉所说 有植物挡着恐龙不会知道你在这儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Sarah said, the plants make it so the animals won't know you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.14,0:51:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是这样说 我可记得你讲过的那些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just saying that. I remember the stories you told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.27,0:51:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这次跟那些完全不一样 我们现在的处境和以前完全不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is nothing like that. We're in a completely different situation now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.91,0:51:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 有办法和拖车联系吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls there a way to communicate with the trailer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.79,0:51:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它又在动了 再多来点吗啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's moving again, more morphine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.79,0:51:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不清楚他的代谢水平 太多了会杀死它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea what his metabolism is. We'll kill him with too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.63,0:51:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 帮个忙 把那儿按住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l need your hand here. Put some pressure there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.30,0:51:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人接 真令人吃惊 我怎么能下去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No answer. What a surprise. How do I get down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.76,0:51:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这根带子绑着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie this belt around you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.02,0:51:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你要上哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.81,0:51:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这儿 爸爸 留在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here. Come on, stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.98,0:52:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧这根绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squeeze this rope hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.81,0:52:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓得越紧 降得越慢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The harder you squeeze, the slower you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.15,0:52:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你根本就不抓绳子… - 我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you don't squeeze at all… - I get the idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.90,0:52:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 留下来吧 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, please stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.07,0:52:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待在这儿吧 求你了 - 甜心 女王？女神？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay here, please. - Honey, the queen? The goddess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.16,0:52:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵感？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your inspiration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.37,0:52:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你说对了 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're talking. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.96,0:52:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就回来 我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm coming right back. I give you my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.25,0:52:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你从来都言而无信！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you never keep your word!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.76,0:52:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,私下说的话 我会抓得更紧一些的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I would have squeezed just a little harder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.60,0:52:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 就快完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, l'm almost finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.89,0:52:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我还需要一点粘合剂 随便什么让我能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. I need another adhesive. Something pliable I can…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.69,0:52:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.78,0:52:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,口香糖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.07,0:53:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把注射器装上青霉素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the amoxicillin and fill a syringe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.11,0:53:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点给它注射抗生素 然后它就可以离开这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick injection of antibiotics and he's out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.83,0:53:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一生也只有这一次 会因为救了它而被它杀掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once in your life, would it kill you to pick it up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.83,0:53:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我把它弄出去 - 不要 我们正在固定它的腿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me get it out of here. - No, we just set its leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.51,0:53:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙妈妈生气了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy's very angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.84,0:55:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是猎食行为的表现 伊恩 它们在搜寻而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't hunting behaviour, lan. They're searching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.92,0:55:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来这儿是找它们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came for their infant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.22,0:55:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不要让它们失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not disappoint them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.39,0:55:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get his head, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.27,0:55:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.52,0:55:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱住它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.19,0:55:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把口套取掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muzzle off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.36,0:56:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请讲 埃迪？- 它们回到丛林中去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Eddie? - They're going back to the jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.28,0:56:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道了 我看到了 凯丽怎么样？- 她很好 就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. I see. How's Kelly? - She's fine. She's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.91,0:56:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.95,0:56:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯丽 你还好吧？- 嗯 我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kelly, are you okay? - Yeah, l'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.95,0:56:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在那儿 不要乱跑 我马上就回来 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there. Don't move. I'll be right back up. Understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.08,0:56:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.55,0:56:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我苦苦哀求你们听我说 我用的是简单明白的英语…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l beg people to listen to me. I use plain, simple English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.55,0:56:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.84,0:56:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那幕将成为你的书里精彩的一章吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should make an interesting chapter in your book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.80,0:56:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于霸王龙父性的论点现在有学术依据了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The debate over the parental instincts of the T. Rex is now academic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.32,0:56:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 情况会变得糟糕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. This is gonna be bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.21,0:57:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们正在把我们推下悬崖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pushing us over the cliff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.88,0:57:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.68,0:57:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 加把劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.31,0:57:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一旦我们离开这儿… - 往树林里跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Once we're out of here… - lnto the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.52,0:57:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 径直往树林里跑 快啊！- 它们在从这儿袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Straight into the woods. Come on! - This is where they hit us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.53,0:57:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随便什么 抓住！- 抓牢了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on to something! - Hang on to something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.70,0:58:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝 上帝 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, God, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.91,0:58:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.21,0:58:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下来救你 我来了 平静点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm coming down for you. Here I come. Stay still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.54,0:58:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I come, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.26,0:58:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星电话 别让它掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The satellite phone, get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.59,0:59:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.27,0:59:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手抓住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.45,0:59:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的幸运背包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lucky pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.87,0:59:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l got her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.24,1:00:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼克？- 我们在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nick? - We're in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.24,1:00:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 坚持住 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Hold on! l'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.07,1:00:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.58,1:00:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.38,1:00:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽呢？你把凯丽怎么安排的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly. What'd you do with Kelly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.71,1:00:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事 她在上面的笼子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's okay. She's in the High Hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.92,1:00:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人受伤吗？你们需要什么？- 绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's hurt? What do you need? - We need rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.93,1:00:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳子 还有其他的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rope. Anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.18,1:00:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三个奶油汉堡 什么馅都行 - 我的不要洋葱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three cheeseburgers with everything. - No onions on mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.10,1:00:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要一个苹果卷饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an apple turnover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.93,1:01:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.18,1:01:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.06,1:01:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳子来了我们就离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the rope. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.89,1:01:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来了 - 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm coming. - Now, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.85,1:01:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪 你没事吧？- 没事 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie, you all right? - Yeah. l'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.73,1:01:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要绳子 把它扔下来 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the rope. Throw it down here. Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.86,1:01:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔得漂亮 你把绳子绑牢了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good throw. Did you tie this to anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.66,1:02:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在往下滑！- 我们在往下滑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're sliding! - We're sliding down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.72,1:02:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.78,1:04:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬快一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lncrease your rate of climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.80,1:06:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的通讯设备都完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our communication equipment's been destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.64,1:07:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 如果你们的无线电和 卫星电话在拖车里的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if your radio and satellite phone were in those trailers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.68,1:07:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们确实在拖车里 - 那我们被困在这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were. - Then we're stuck here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.31,1:07:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起都被困在这儿了 真是谢谢你们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stuck together, thanks to you people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.77,1:07:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来是为了观察 而你们是来这儿掠夺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came to watch. You came to strip-mine the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.65,1:07:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚远点 - 至少我们是有备而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back off. - At least we came prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.11,1:07:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在另一个岛上 五年的努力和 高压电网都不能做到有备无患{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years of work and electrified fence couldn't prepare the other island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.03,1:07:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以为你们这些人就能够做到？- 你们只是强盗 是掠夺者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think your Marlboro men will help? - You're looters. You came to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.33,1:07:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无权这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.58,1:07:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,死而复生的恐龙才没有权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An extinct animal brought back to life has no rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.33,1:07:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它之所以存在是因为我们制造了它 它属于我们 受我们控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt exists because we made it. We patented it. We own it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.92,1:07:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有问题吗？- 你不就是问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You looking for a problem? - And I found you, didn't l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.72,1:07:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.68,1:07:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那个世界头号杂种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're that Earth First bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.10,1:07:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么世界头号？- 专门破坏别人的好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's Earth First? - Professional saboteurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.44,1:07:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是环保主义者！- 罪犯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Environmentalists! - Criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.94,1:07:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off! Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.77,1:07:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把幼龙带到营地改变了成年恐龙对领地范围的感知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving the baby to our camp may have changed the adults' perceived territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.69,1:07:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.28,1:07:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是它们攻击拖车的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they attacked the trailers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.99,1:08:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们现在会捍卫这一整个地区 - 我们必须马上离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're defending this entire area now. - We have to move now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.62,1:08:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,上哪儿？我们的船和他们的运输机都不能收到我们的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To where? Our boat and their airlift are waiting for orders we can't send.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.58,1:08:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旧的操作大楼附近有一个通讯中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a communications centre here near the old operations building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.92,1:08:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有东西都使用地热能源 它们永远都不需要充电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything ran on geothermal power. lt was never meant to need replenishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.38,1:08:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能够到那儿 我们就能够用无线电与运输机联系上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can get here, we can send a radio call to the airlift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.01,1:08:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道它的频率？- 在这本书里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know the frequency? - Here in this book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.85,1:08:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会牢记这些的 - 到那个村子有多远？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll mind those. - How far is the village?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.68,1:08:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天的行程 或者更多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A day's walk, maybe more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.11,1:08:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那倒不是问题 - 那么问题是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not the problem. - What is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.82,1:08:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么会成为问题？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.28,1:08:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Velociraptors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.04,1:08:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的筑巢地点就在岛心 这也是为什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their nesting sites are in the island's interior, which is why…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.75,1:08:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …我们要待在小岛周边 - 等等 什么是「迅…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …we were keeping to the outer rim. - Wait. What's a Veloc…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.08,1:08:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙 肉食动物 群出猎食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Velociraptor. Carnivore. Pack hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.76,1:08:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,两米高 口鼻部很长…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two meters tall, long snout…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.09,1:09:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…双目视觉 前臂强健 双足都有致命的爪子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…binocular vision, strong forearms, killing claws on both feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.47,1:09:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,霸王龙也可能跟上我们 如果它觉得我们对它的幼崽造成威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rexes may track us, too, if they feel we're a threat to their infant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.18,1:09:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 一旦我们离开它们的领土 我们就可以甩掉它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we'll lose them once we leave their territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.52,1:09:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要心存侥幸 霸王龙的嗅觉腔在所有生物化石记录中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bet on it. Tyrannosaur has the largest proportional olfactory cavity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.73,1:09:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是比例最大的 除了一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of any creature in fossil record, except one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.20,1:09:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,土耳其秃鹫 能够闻到10英里以外的气味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Turkey Vulture could scent up to 10 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.78,1:09:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这很令人激动 但是我说我们应该向村子进发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. This is all very thrilling, but I say we should head for the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.45,1:09:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以回到泻湖下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could head back down to the lagoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.87,1:09:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在露天外面 靠近大量使用的水源…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sit out in the open, near a heavily used water source…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.29,1:09:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …期待你们的队长回来？- 他不会回来的 他更清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …hope that your captain comes back? - He won't. He knows better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.71,1:09:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们向村子进发 找到藏身之处并且寻求帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we head for the village, find shelter and call for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.05,1:09:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,霸王龙刚刚吃过东西 他暂时 不会再把我们当成食物了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rex just fed, so he won't stalk us for food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.76,1:09:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚吃过？你是指埃迪？请你放尊重一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fed? You mean Eddie? Show some respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.89,1:09:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他牺牲自己的生命救了我们 - 他的麻烦也结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He saved our lives by giving his. - Then his troubles are over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.44,1:09:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的是肉食动物不会 在不饿的时候猎食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point is predators don't hunt when they're not hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.36,1:09:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 只有人类才那么做 - 你伤了我们的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, only humans do. - You're breaking our heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.90,1:09:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好！让我们开始享受逃命的乐趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saddle up! Let's get this moveable feast underway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.34,1:10:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 牛仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, cowboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.34,1:10:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点口香糖吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some gum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.30,1:10:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来有很多这方面的常识 怎么会在这个鬼地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem like you have common sense. Why the hell are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.68,1:10:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个岛上的某个地方有着 迄今为止最厉害的猎杀者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere on this island is the greatest predator that ever lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.14,1:10:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二厉害的猎杀者必须拿下他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second greatest predator must take him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.98,1:10:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你打算用那个？- 如果他不投降我就会用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You going to use that? - If he doesn't surrender, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.28,1:10:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see it. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.99,1:10:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些动物数千万年来第一次存在于这个世界…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The animal exists for the first time in tens of millions of years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.66,1:10:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…而杀掉它们却是你唯一的表达方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the only way you can express yourself is to kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.74,1:10:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得20年前的那个人吗？我忘了他的名字了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that chap about 20 years ago? I forget his name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.83,1:10:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在没有任何氧气的情况下登顶 下来时几乎死掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climbed Everest without any oxygen. Came down nearly dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.21,1:10:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们问他：「为什么你要上去找死？」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They asked him, "Why did you go up there to die?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.25,1:11:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 「不 我上去是为了寻找生命的价值 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "I didn't. I went up there to live."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.26,1:11:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会祝你好运的 你已经偏离了本来有希望的开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't wish you luck on your new venture. You're off to a promising start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.18,1:11:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的队伍完好无缺 我很遗憾你们失去了一个伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My team is intact. l'm sorry for the loss of your man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.39,1:11:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要批评一个有想法的人很容易 只要假定它有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy to criticise someone who generates an idea, assumes the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.65,1:11:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你试图象哈蒙德一样说话时 反而像东施效颦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you try to sound like Hammond, it comes off as a hustle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.78,1:11:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的错 人们总说天才是隔代的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault. They say talent skips a generation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.45,1:11:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我肯定你的孩子会聪明绝顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm sure your kids will be sharp as tacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.37,1:11:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈蒙德的成就超过了他的能力 我的还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hammond's reach exceeded his grasp. Mine does not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.79,1:11:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把恐龙带出这个小岛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking dinosaurs off this island…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.70,1:11:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是漫长历史中无数糟糕 点子里面最糟糕的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is the worst idea in the long, sad history of bad ideas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.71,1:11:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你意识到这一点的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And l'll be there when you learn that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.25,1:12:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息一下 五分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a break. Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.63,1:12:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you injured?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.64,1:12:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是小恐龙的 我帮他接断腿 环境潮湿里它干不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's the baby's. I set its broken leg. lt won't dry in the humidity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.35,1:12:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兰 问个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roland, a word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.15,1:12:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'd love to know where we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.70,1:12:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和亚哈交朋友呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making friends with Ahab?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.05,1:13:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 我要去方便一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, l'm going to the ladies' room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.76,1:13:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿等我好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for me here. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.44,1:14:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷看是不礼貌的行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not polite to sneak up on people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.25,1:14:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特！你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter! Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.51,1:14:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这儿都找遍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l got turned around in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.97,1:14:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.06,1:14:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 说话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, let me hear from you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.89,1:16:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 休息结束 继续前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, break's over. Moving on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.23,1:16:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.06,1:17:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.29,1:18:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最后一次见他是什么时候？- 10或者15分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When did you last see him? - 10, 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.08,1:18:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 还有你 如果他还活着 我们会找到他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me. And you. If he's alive, we'll find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.88,1:18:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的人继续走 10分钟后你们会到达山脊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you go on. You'll reach the ridge in 10 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.55,1:18:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿等我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for us there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.31,1:18:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不要给那个小女孩讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one tells the little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.56,1:18:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Let's carry on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.40,1:19:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.03,1:19:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Up, up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.24,1:19:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 让我们离开这个鬼地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right guys, let's get the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.96,1:20:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到他了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.09,1:20:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一些它们不吃的部分 地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the parts they didn't like. Map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.23,1:20:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,操作大楼就在下面…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The operations building is right down in there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.44,1:20:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…离这些悬崖底部只有大约1.5英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…about a mile and a half from the base of these cliffs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.44,1:20:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 我看见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know that? - l've seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.36,1:20:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要爬下去并不容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The climb down won't be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.70,1:20:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以让他们再多睡一小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll let them sleep one more hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.70,1:20:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后叫醒他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we hit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.12,1:22:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.66,1:23:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下！别动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down! Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.33,1:23:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.92,1:23:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要看 跑！跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look, just run! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.52,1:23:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.12,1:25:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.88,1:25:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它够不着你 向后靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't reach you! Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.25,1:25:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它碰不到我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't reach us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.73,1:25:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！上帝！蛇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! A snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.15,1:25:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,往后！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.49,1:26:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.66,1:26:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它又回来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.96,1:26:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.05,1:26:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.02,1:26:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要到草丛里去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go into the long grass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.07,1:26:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要到草丛里去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not into the long grass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.68,1:27:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.34,1:27:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么？- 我想是阿杰的包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - I think it's Ajay's bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.99,1:28:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 能都快有多快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, as fast as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.16,1:28:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.94,1:28:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见那儿有建筑物了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l see structures there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.78,1:28:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说通讯中心在操作大楼里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said the communications centre is in the operations building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.53,1:28:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会到那儿去发送无线电 到那儿见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll get in there and send the radio call. See you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.37,1:28:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等我们 - 时间不等人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait for us. - Every second counts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.12,1:28:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你赶得上 那尽管试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can keep up, you're welcome to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.37,1:28:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 我们就来 - 不！休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, here we come. - No! Rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.17,1:31:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.01,1:31:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,CQ InGen捕猎队领队呼叫捕猎队基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}CQ, this is lnGen Operations Harvest Leader to Harvest Base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.05,1:31:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 这里是InGen捕猎队领队…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeating, l'm calling for lnGen Harvest Leader…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.26,1:31:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …呼叫InGen捕猎队基地 - 请讲 捕猎队领队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …seeking lnGen Harvest Base. - Go ahead, Harvest Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.97,1:31:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行动遭受到严重伤亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The operation has suffered severe casualties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.60,1:31:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸存者目前处于极度危险的状态 我要你立刻派出营救队伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The survivors are now in mortal danger. I need you to send rescue immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.11,1:31:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这儿的相对座标是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our co-ordinates here are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.94,1:31:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,…9度58分 北纬85度…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…9°58' north, 85°…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.58,1:33:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 这边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.34,1:33:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！随便哪儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lnside! Anywhere!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.09,1:35:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.42,1:35:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我出去后上哪儿？- 我随后就出去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do I go when l'm out? - l'm right behind you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.49,1:35:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.42,1:35:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,上这儿来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.98,1:36:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！说你呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.76,1:36:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校把你从队里刷下来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The school cut you from the team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.80,1:36:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.59,1:38:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我们走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.89,1:38:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.95,1:38:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他人怎么办？- 另一架直升机正在赶来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the other survivors? - Another chopper's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.48,1:39:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.36,1:39:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个纪念品了 他们不会带着的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one souvenir they won't be taking with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.16,1:39:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出那只小霸王龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the infant tyrannosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.24,1:39:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兰知道窝在哪儿 我要把它带上飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roland knows where the nest is. I want it on my jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.91,1:39:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它直接带到圣达戈的医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll take it directly to the infirmary in San Diego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.71,1:39:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点 我想在那只母的知道以前就上飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry. I want to be airborne before the female knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.10,1:39:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能拯救了InGen{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably saved lnGen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.06,1:39:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这趟旅行以后我们失去了所有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost everything we came after on this trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.60,1:39:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这只恐龙和它的幼崽拯救了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this animal and its infant will bail us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.02,1:39:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.98,1:39:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得到了你的战利品！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got your trophy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.11,1:39:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只公的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A buck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.03,1:39:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是活的 人们会排起长队来欣赏它而我们受益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's alive! Everyone will line up and appreciate it and what you did for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.53,1:39:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.24,1:40:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没能做到 阿杰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't make it. Ajay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.62,1:40:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.92,1:40:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 真的很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.42,1:40:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得每一个帮助我的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l remember the people who help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.80,1:40:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想去 圣达戈有一个工作给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a job for you in San Diego, if you want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.59,1:40:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.22,1:40:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在这个死亡公司上花了太多时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've spent enough time in the company of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.86,1:40:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.09,1:41:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五年前 约翰·哈蒙德有一个梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen years ago, John Hammond had a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.43,1:41:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,和约翰自己一样 这个梦想宏伟 独特 引人注目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like John himself, the dream was grand. It was outsized. It was bold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.06,1:41:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不切实际 且不可实现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was impractical. It was not to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.77,1:41:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起再过半小时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half an hour from now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.61,1:41:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…约翰·哈蒙德的梦想 将变为现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…John Hammond's dream, re-imagined, will come true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.90,1:41:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用了建造度假胜地百分之一的费用…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For.01 of the cost of building a destination resort…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.87,1:42:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是勒德洛先生的聚会吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls this the Ludlow affair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.74,1:42:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里是私人处所 - 我们被邀请了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is private property. - We're on the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.91,1:42:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过身 回到车里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around, get back in your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.58,1:42:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哈丁博士 我是马尔科姆博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dr. Harding, l'm Dr. Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.25,1:42:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有勒德洛先生要的测试结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have Mr. Ludlow's test results.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.58,1:42:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好消息 也有坏消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's good and bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.42,1:42:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我们将为圣达戈侏罗纪公园洗礼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight we will christen Jurassic Park, San Diego…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.17,1:42:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…它的巨大吸引力必能超过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a mega-attraction that will drive turnstile numbers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.42,1:42:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…世界上其他任何主题公园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to rival any theme park in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.85,1:42:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要感谢你们每一个人 在早上这几个小时来到这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l want to thank each one of you for coming in these wee small hours of the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.44,1:42:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船到了 - 提前了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The ship is here. - It's early?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.40,1:42:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好过来一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better come now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.94,1:42:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太令人激动了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so exciting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.36,1:42:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看见那一对了吗？- 先生 你应该看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See that couple? - Sir, you need to look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.95,1:42:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们靠近点看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them see this up close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.00,1:42:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一条到海岸警卫队的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l need a direct line to the Coast Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.50,1:42:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这是他们的发射器信号 冒险号5888{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. That's their transponder signal, Venture 5888.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.71,1:42:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们正在进入 但是我没法联系上他们 - 再试一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're coming in, but I can't raise them. - Try again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.84,1:43:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险号船长 这里是InGen港长 收到吗？完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skipper, SS Venture, this is lnGen Harbour Master. Do you copy? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.68,1:43:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险号船长 你正在快速接近防波堤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skipper, SS Venture, you are approaching the breakwater at flank speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.48,1:43:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻减速 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reduce at once. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.83,1:43:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险号 立刻减速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}SS Venture, reduce your speed at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.29,1:43:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险号 这里是InGen港长 你正在进入停靠区域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}SS Venture, this is lnGen Harbour Master. You are entering a docking area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.59,1:43:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在看什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's everybody looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.01,1:43:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该待在车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should've stayed in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.44,1:44:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 勒德洛先生？- 我不知道 我看起来怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay, Mr. Ludlow? - I don't know. How do I look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.22,1:45:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 上帝！- 船员上哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - Where's the crew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.31,1:45:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.49,1:45:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到有燃油泄漏！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l smell a fuel leak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.15,1:46:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查货舱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the cargo hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.28,1:46:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能有船员在下面 - 大家下船！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There may be crew down there. - Everybody off the boat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.79,1:46:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！离开那儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Get away from that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.33,1:46:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你是约翰·哈蒙德了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're John Hammond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.44,1:47:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它为什么不平静下来？- 它中过两支毒标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why wasn't it tranquillised? - lt was hit it with two darts of Carfentanil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.74,1:47:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 剂量超过10毫克 - 那让它昏迷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt was over 10 milligrams. - That'd put it in a coma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.32,1:47:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它停止了呼吸 我们用环丙甲羟二羟吗啡酮给它减轻症状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt stopped breathing. We gave it naltrexone to counteract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.24,1:47:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不知道该用多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we didn't know how much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.50,1:47:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道多少剂量就 给它用了麻醉药拮抗剂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave an antagonist without knowing the dosage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.21,1:47:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让它处于发作性睡眠状态 它现在睡醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put it in a narcoleptic state. It's a locomotive now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.17,1:47:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在这儿有所准备 - 船上还有其他恐龙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're prepared here. - Any more dinosaurs on the boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.17,1:47:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了 那只幼崽乘飞机过来 我们用它来使它平静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the infant was flown in. We had this to tranquillise it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.51,1:47:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还有那只幼崽？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the infant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.02,1:48:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.27,1:48:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只恐龙有些脱水 首先 它会找个水源…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The animal's dehydrated. First, it'll go to a water source…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.40,1:48:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…然后 它会找第二样东西 它的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then look for the next thing its body needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.28,1:48:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的装备都在这儿 我们必须把它弄回船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the containment equipment is here. We must get it back to the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.49,1:48:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know what you're gonna say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.24,1:48:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们把它的孩子抱到拖车时 它来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we brought the baby to the trailer, it came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.87,1:48:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有理由在这儿它不会这么干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason why it won't do the same thing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.00,1:48:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,幼崽在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the infant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.63,1:48:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在保安设施里 怎么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln a secured facility. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.10,1:48:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安设施在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the facility?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.47,1:50:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,后院里有一只恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a dinosaur in our backyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.23,1:50:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,本杰明 你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benjamin, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.40,1:50:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.74,1:50:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.91,1:50:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 后院里有一只恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. There's a dinosaur in our backyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.03,1:50:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是你应该给他讲故事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is, you need to read to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.71,1:50:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你让他晚饭多吃点 他晚上就不会折腾了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you serve him dinner, he won't be up all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.46,1:50:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个弱智鱼缸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the stupid fish tank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.29,1:50:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要一个合适的夜灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs a proper nightlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.88,1:50:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还不如弄得像白天一样 - 把它关了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt may as well be daytime. - Just turn it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.78,1:51:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,减速 减速！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down. Slow it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.85,1:51:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.94,1:51:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它睡着了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sedated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.40,1:51:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得很香 帮我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really heavily. Give me a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.12,1:51:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当那只大的再看见我们和它的孩子在一起时 它会不会像这样：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the adult sees us again with his baby, isn't he going to be like:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.37,1:51:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「又是你们！」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.62,1:51:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有一些生气的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be some angry recognition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.67,1:51:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道？它可能还乐于见到我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows? He may be just happy to see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.42,1:52:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.09,1:52:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要带走这个小孩儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking the kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.55,1:52:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真想阻止我们 开枪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really want to stop us, shoot us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.22,1:52:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么才能找到那只大的？- 跟着尖叫声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How will we find the adult? - Follow the screams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.10,1:53:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边 - 噢 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There. - Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.91,1:53:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它中毒太深了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too drugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.12,1:53:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不出声的话 它是不会知道我们抱着它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't know we have it unless it makes some sound!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.91,1:53:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 快 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.26,1:54:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.27,1:54:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 开慢一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lan, slow down a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.28,1:54:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.92,1:54:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小家伙就快完全醒了 你知道你要上哪儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's almost fully awake. You know where you're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.59,1:54:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些仓库另一面的水边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The waterfront's on the other side of these warehouses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.47,1:54:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有路过去吗？- 可能有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ls there a way through? - There could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.82,1:55:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.86,1:55:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在必须跟着我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to follow me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.74,1:55:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.86,1:55:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带上它了？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got him? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.24,1:55:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 霸王龙在哪儿？还在我们后面吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready? - Where's the Rex? ls it still behind us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.59,1:55:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,水就在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.88,1:55:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪打它 告诉他们开枪打它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot it. Tell them to shoot it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.18,1:55:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你这个蠢货 大的 打那个大的 我要那个小的活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you idiot, the adult. Shoot the adult. I want the baby back alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.59,1:56:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对它做过什么？我要那只幼崽！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done with it? I want that infant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.83,1:56:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.95,1:57:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.31,1:59:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲板上有一流的枪手…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a first-rate shot of the deck of the ship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.86,1:59:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这个时候 原来装恐龙的货舱里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the cargo hold that, for the moment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.65,2:00:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…又装着那只恐龙 也许那只幼崽正躺在它的旁边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…contains the animal itself, presumably with the infant alongside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.36,2:00:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我们推算 他们快接近这次行程的一半了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By our calculations, they are nearing the halfway point of this trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.08,2:00:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你在那儿能听见我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, can you hear me there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.91,2:00:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 能听见 伯纳德 我们还有一半的行程就到岛上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I can, Bernard. We are halfway to the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.04,2:00:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离我们现在的位置有206海里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is 206 nautical miles from our present location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.46,2:00:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,船的航行速度是20节…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship is moving at 20 knots…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.42,2:00:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…将在东部时间上午11点30分到达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which will put it in at about 11:30 a.m., Eastern time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.80,2:00:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,海军极度关切之事已经安全了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the Navy's primary concerns has been safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.43,2:00:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们周围不断壮大的护卫队…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we look at the ever-growing escort around the ship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.89,2:00:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…就知道圣达戈事件不会再有机会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're taking no chances of a repeat of the San Diego incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.27,2:00:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来听一段录音…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a moment to run the tape…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.52,2:00:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这是今天早些时候对约翰·哈蒙德的采访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of our interview earlier today with John Hammond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.73,2:00:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是InGen生物工程公司的前任总裁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the former head of InGen BioEngineering…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.82,2:00:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…现在是这次转移行动的带头人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the man who is now spearheading this movement…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.66,2:00:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不仅是把这些恐龙带回岛上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not only to return the animals to their island…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.41,2:00:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…也是为了保持小岛自身的完整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but to keep the island itself intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.08,2:00:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是绝对重要的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is absolutely imperative…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.83,2:01:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们与哥斯达黎加生物保护部门共同工作…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that we work with the Costa Rican Department of Biological Preserves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.17,2:01:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…要建立一套…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to establish a set of rules…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.92,2:01:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…保护和隔离小岛的措施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for the preservation and isolation of that island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.18,2:01:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些生物要活下来 需要的是我们离开 而不是我们的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These creatures require our absence to survive, not our help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.23,2:01:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且如果我们能够只是让一小步…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we could only step aside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.27,2:01:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…信任大自然的力量…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and trust in nature…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.15,2:01:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…生命总有出路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…life will find a way.{\r}
